<title>UK: UK monetary meeting set for 1100 GMT start on Weds.</title>
<headline>UK monetary meeting set for 1100 GMT start on Weds.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The planned monetary meeting between British Chancellor of the Exchequer Kenneth Clarke and Bank of England governor Eddie Geoerge on Wednesday is scheduled to begin at 1100 GMT, a British Treasury official said on Monday.</p>
<p>&quot;The monetary meeting is expected to start at 11 a.m.,&quot; a Treasury official told Reuters.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 6784</p>
</text>
